00:11:02.896 --> 00:11:04.106
Nicki Minaj.

00:11:04.773 --> 00:11:06.608
From Betty Boop to Buffie the Body.

00:11:06.858 --> 00:11:08.026
When I shake this ass,

00:11:08.026 --> 00:11:09.903
