00:11:37.639 --> 00:11:40.475
I twerk because it’s unique
to the Black experience.

00:11:40.642 --> 00:11:42.060
It’s unique to my culture,

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:44.020
and it means something real to me.

00:11:45.355 --> 00:11:46.773
I twerk because I’m talented.

00:11:48.525 --> 00:11:51.778
(Applause and cheers)

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:55.073
