is a beautiful thing.

00:12:08.503 --> 00:12:11.673
(Applause and cheers)

00:12:12.215 --> 00:12:14.634
I twerk because it’s as natural
to me as breathing.

00:12:14.634 --> 00:12:16.344
Black women invented twerking,

00:12:16.344 --> 00:12:18.221
